---
import { supabaseConfigured } from '../lib/supabase';
import EditorialCenter from './EditorialCenter.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<section class="admin-shell" data-admin-app data-configured={String(supabaseConfigured)} data-base={base}>
  <aside class="admin-sidebar" hidden data-admin-sidebar>
    <div class="admin-brand"><span>B</span><strong>Rutas B</strong></div>
    <nav aria-label="Administración">
      <button class="active" data-admin-view="summary">Resumen</button>
      <button data-admin-view="routes">Rutas</button>
      <button data-admin-view="design">Centro editorial</button>
      <button data-admin-view="availability">Disponibilidad</button>
      <button data-admin-view="bookings">Reservas</button>
      <button data-admin-view="messages">Mensajes</button>
      <button data-admin-view="reviews">Reseñas</button>
    </nav>
    <a class="admin-public-link" href={base} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ver web pública ↗</a><button class="admin-signout" data-signout>Cerrar sesión</button>
  </aside>

  <div class="admin-login section" data-login-view>
    <div class="admin-card">
      <div class="admin-lock" aria-hidden="true">B</div>
      <p class="kicker dark">Zona privada</p><h1>Administración de Rutas B</h1>
      {!supabaseConfigured && <div class="admin-notice"><strong>Modo de preparación</strong><p>Agrega las variables de Supabase para activar el acceso. Ninguna contraseña queda en el código.</p></div>}
      <form data-login-form>
        <label class="field"><span>Correo de administración</span><input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="username" required disabled={!supabaseConfigured} /></label>
        <label class="field"><span>Contraseña</span><input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required disabled={!supabaseConfigured} /></label>
        <p class="admin-error" data-admin-error role="alert"></p>
        <button class="button primary" type="submit" disabled={!supabaseConfigured}>Entrar</button>
        <button class="admin-recovery-link" type="button" data-show-recovery disabled={!supabaseConfigured}>¿Olvidaste tu contraseña?</button>
      </form>
      <form data-recovery-form hidden>
        <p>Escribe tu correo de administración. Recibirás un enlace seguro para crear una contraseña nueva.</p>
        <label class="field"><span>Correo de administración</span><input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required /></label>
        <p class="admin-error" data-recovery-error role="alert"></p>
        <p class="admin-success" data-recovery-message role="status"></p>
        <button class="button primary" type="submit">Enviar enlace de recuperación</button>
        <button class="admin-recovery-link" type="button" data-cancel-recovery>Volver al acceso</button>
      </form>
      <div class="admin-modules"><strong>Módulos independientes</strong><span>Resumen</span><span>Rutas</span><span>Diseño</span><span>Disponibilidad</span><span>Reservas</span><span>Mensajes</span><span>Reseñas</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="admin-main" hidden data-dashboard>
    <header class="admin-topbar"><div><p>Administración</p><h1 data-admin-heading>Resumen operativo</h1></div><span data-admin-name></span></header>
    <div class="admin-content">
      <section class="admin-view" data-view="summary">
        <div class="metric-grid"><article><span>Nuevas</span><strong data-metric="received">0</strong></article><article><span>En revisión</span><strong data-metric="reviewing">0</strong></article><article><span>Confirmadas</span><strong data-metric="confirmed">0</strong></article><article><span>Total visible</span><strong data-metric="total">0</strong></article></div>
        <div class="admin-panel"><div class="admin-panel-head"><div><p class="kicker dark">Actividad reciente</p><h2>Solicitudes</h2></div><button class="button outline" data-refresh>Actualizar</button></div><div class="admin-table-wrap"><table class="admin-table"><thead><tr><th>Referencia</th><th>Cliente</th><th>Ruta</th><th>Fecha de ruta</th><th>Creada el</th><th>Personas</th><th>Estado</th></tr></thead><tbody data-bookings-body></tbody></table></div><p class="admin-empty" data-admin-empty hidden>No hay solicitudes registradas.</p></div>
      </section>
      <section class="admin-view" data-view="bookings" hidden>
        <div class="admin-panel booking-management">
          <div class="admin-panel-head"><div><p class="kicker dark">Gestión de reservas</p><h2>Reservas</h2></div><button class="button outline" type="button" data-bookings-export>Exportar CSV</button></div>
          <form class="booking-filters" data-bookings-filters><label class="field"><span>Buscar</span><input name="query" type="search" placeholder="Referencia o cliente" /></label><label class="field"><span>Ruta</span><select name="route"><option value="">Todas las rutas</option></select></label><label class="field"><span>Fecha</span><input name="date" type="date" /></label><label class="field"><span>Estado</span><select name="status"><option value="">Todos los estados</option><option value="received">Recibida</option><option value="reviewing">En revisión</option><option value="confirmed">Confirmada</option><option value="cancelled">Cancelada</option><option value="completed">Completada</option></select></label><button class="button primary" type="submit">Filtrar</button><button class="button outline" type="button" data-bookings-clear>Limpiar</button></form>
          <p class="admin-error" data-bookings-error role="alert"></p><div class="admin-table-wrap"><table class="admin-table booking-table"><thead><tr><th>Referencia</th><th>Ruta</th><th>Fecha de ruta</th><th>Creada el</th><th>Personas</th><th>Estado</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody data-bookings-list></tbody></table></div><p class="admin-empty" data-bookings-empty hidden>No hay reservas con estos filtros.</p><nav class="booking-pagination" aria-label="Paginación de reservas"><button class="button outline" type="button" data-bookings-prev>Anterior</button><span data-bookings-page></span><button class="button outline" type="button" data-bookings-next>Siguiente</button></nav>
        </div><aside class="admin-panel booking-detail" data-booking-detail hidden aria-live="polite"></aside>
      </section>
      <section class="admin-view" data-view="routes" hidden>
        <div class="admin-panel"><div class="admin-panel-head"><div><p class="kicker dark">Centro editorial</p><h2>Rutas</h2></div><button class="button primary" type="button" data-route-new>Nueva ruta</button></div><p class="admin-error" data-route-error role="alert"></p><div class="route-admin-list" data-route-list></div></div>
        <aside class="admin-panel route-editor" data-route-editor hidden><form data-route-form><h2 data-route-editor-title>Editar ruta</h2><input type="hidden" name="id" />
<fieldset><legend>Identidad y estado</legend><div class="form-grid">
<label class="field full"><span>Título público</span><input name="title" required maxlength="160" /></label>
<label class="field"><span>Antetítulo</span><input name="eyebrow" maxlength="180" /></label>
<label class="field"><span>Estado visible</span><select name="statusLabel"><option value="Disponible">Disponible</option><option value="En preparación">En preparación</option></select></label>
<label class="field full"><span>Promesa corta</span><textarea name="promise" rows="3" maxlength="500"></textarea></label>
<label class="field full"><span>Descripción de la experiencia</span><textarea name="description" rows="7" maxlength="4000"></textarea></label>
</div></fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Información práctica</legend><div class="form-grid">
<label class="field"><span>Duración mostrada</span><input name="duration" maxlength="160" /></label>
<label class="field"><span>Formato</span><input name="format" maxlength="240" /></label>
<label class="field"><span>Zona</span><input name="area" maxlength="180" /></label>
<label class="field"><span>Idiomas (separados por coma)</span><input name="languages" maxlength="180" /></label>
<label class="field full"><span>Públicos (uno por línea)</span><textarea name="audience" rows="4"></textarea></label>
<label class="field full"><span>Punto de inicio</span><textarea name="startingPoint" rows="3"></textarea></label>
<label class="field full"><span>Punto final</span><textarea name="endingPoint" rows="3"></textarea></label>
<label class="field full"><span>Paradas (una por línea y en el orden del recorrido)</span><textarea name="stops" rows="6"></textarea></label>
</div></fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Contenido comercial</legend><div class="form-grid">
<label class="field full"><span>Incluye (un elemento por línea)</span><textarea name="includes" rows="5"></textarea></label>
<label class="field full"><span>No incluye (un elemento por línea)</span><textarea name="excludes" rows="5"></textarea></label>
<label class="field full"><span>Accesibilidad</span><textarea name="accessibility" rows="4"></textarea></label>
<label class="field"><span>Precio individual mostrado</span><input name="price" maxlength="160" /></label>
<label class="field"><span>Precio de grupo mostrado</span><input name="groupPrice" maxlength="160" /></label>
<label class="field"><span>Orden en el catálogo</span><input name="sortOrder" type="number" min="0" max="999" /></label>
<label class="consent"><input name="featured" type="checkbox" /><span>Destacar esta ruta</span></label>
</div></fieldset>
<details class="route-translation-editor" open><summary>English version</summary><p>Edit the public English version of this route here. It is published together with the Spanish version.</p><div class="form-grid">
<label class="field full"><span>Public title</span><input name="enTitle" maxlength="160" /></label><label class="field"><span>Eyebrow</span><input name="enEyebrow" maxlength="180" /></label><label class="field"><span>Visible status</span><select name="enStatusLabel"><option value="Available">Available</option><option value="In preparation">In preparation</option></select></label>
<label class="field full"><span>Short promise</span><textarea name="enPromise" rows="3"></textarea></label><label class="field full"><span>Experience description</span><textarea name="enDescription" rows="6"></textarea></label>
<label class="field"><span>Displayed duration</span><input name="enDuration" /></label><label class="field"><span>Format</span><input name="enFormat" /></label><label class="field"><span>Area</span><input name="enArea" /></label><label class="field"><span>Languages (comma separated)</span><input name="enLanguages" /></label>
<label class="field full"><span>Audiences (one per line)</span><textarea name="enAudience" rows="4"></textarea></label><label class="field full"><span>Starting point</span><textarea name="enStartingPoint" rows="3"></textarea></label><label class="field full"><span>Ending point</span><textarea name="enEndingPoint" rows="3"></textarea></label><label class="field full"><span>Stops (one per line and in route order)</span><textarea name="enStops" rows="6"></textarea></label>
<label class="field full"><span>Included (one per line)</span><textarea name="enIncludes" rows="4"></textarea></label><label class="field full"><span>Not included (one per line)</span><textarea name="enExcludes" rows="4"></textarea></label><label class="field full"><span>Accessibility</span><textarea name="enAccessibility" rows="4"></textarea></label>
<label class="field"><span>Individual price</span><input name="enPrice" /></label><label class="field"><span>Group price</span><input name="enGroupPrice" /></label></div></details><p class="admin-route-state" data-route-publication-state></p><div class="route-editor-actions"><button class="button outline" type="submit">Guardar borrador</button><button class="button primary" type="button" data-route-publish>Publicar en web</button><button class="button outline" type="button" data-route-duplicate>Duplicar como borrador</button></div></form><section class="route-media-panel"><div><h3>Fotos, mapas y documentos</h3><p>La opción <strong>Imagen principal</strong> reemplaza la foto grande de la ruta. En Sagrada Família también actualiza la portada y las cabeceras generales. Puedes publicar inmediatamente o conservar como borrador.</p></div><form class="route-media-form" data-route-media-form><label class="field"><span>Uso</span><select name="role"><option value="hero">Imagen principal</option><option value="gallery">Galería o mapa</option><option value="attachment">Folleto, documento o audio</option></select></label><label class="field"><span>Archivo</span><input name="file" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/avif,application/pdf,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document,audio/mpeg,audio/mp4" required /></label><label class="field"><span>Título visible</span><input name="mediaTitle" maxlength="160" placeholder="Ej.: Folleto de la ruta" /></label><label class="field"><span>Texto alternativo de la imagen</span><input name="altText" maxlength="240" placeholder="Describe lo que aparece en la foto" /></label><button class="button outline" type="submit" value="draft">Subir como borrador</button><button class="button primary" type="submit" value="publish">Subir y publicar en web</button></form><p class="admin-error" data-route-media-error role="status"></p><a class="button outline" data-route-public-link target="_blank" rel="noopener" hidden>Ver la ruta publicada</a><div class="route-media-list" data-route-media-list></div></section><section class="route-history-panel"><h3>Historial</h3><p class="admin-empty" data-route-history-empty hidden>Aún no hay cambios reversibles.</p><div data-route-history></div></section></aside>
      </section>
      <section class="admin-view" data-view="design" hidden><EditorialCenter /></section>
      <section class="admin-view" data-view="availability" hidden><div class="admin-panel availability-admin"><div class="admin-panel-head"><div><p class="kicker dark">Calendario operativo</p><h2>Disponibilidad</h2></div><button class="button outline" type="button" data-availability-refresh>Actualizar</button></div><div class="availability-controls"><label class="field"><span>Ruta</span><select data-availability-route></select></label><label class="field"><span>Capacidad por franja</span><input data-availability-capacity type="number" min="1" max="15" value="15" /></label><button class="button primary" type="button" data-availability-generate>Generar mes</button></div><div class="calendar-toolbar admin-calendar-toolbar"><button type="button" data-admin-month-prev aria-label="Mes anterior">←</button><strong data-admin-calendar-title></strong><button type="button" data-admin-month-next aria-label="Mes siguiente">→</button></div><div class="calendar-weekdays"><span>Lun</span><span>Mar</span><span>Mié</span><span>Jue</span><span>Vie</span><span>Sáb</span><span>Dom</span></div><div class="calendar-grid admin-calendar-grid" data-admin-calendar-grid></div><div class="calendar-legend" aria-label="Leyenda"><span><i class="legend-past"></i> Histórico</span><span><i class="legend-reserved"></i> Con reservas</span><span><i class="legend-open"></i> Disponible</span></div><p class="admin-error" data-availability-message role="status"></p><aside class="availability-day-editor" data-availability-editor hidden><h3 data-availability-day></h3><p data-availability-help>Marca las horas abiertas. Una reserva privada o de partner bloquea la franja automáticamente.</p><div class="availability-occupancy" data-availability-occupancy></div><div class="slot-checks" data-availability-slot-checks><label><input type="checkbox" value="10:00" data-availability-slot /> 10:00</label><label><input type="checkbox" value="12:00" data-availability-slot /> 12:00</label><label><input type="checkbox" value="18:00" data-availability-slot /> 18:00</label><label><input type="checkbox" value="22:00" data-availability-slot /> 22:00</label></div><button class="button primary" type="button" data-availability-save>Guardar día</button></aside></div></section>
      <section class="admin-view" data-view="messages" hidden><div class="admin-panel messages-admin"><div class="admin-panel-head"><div><p class="kicker dark">Consultas desde la web</p><h2>Mensajes <span data-messages-count></span></h2></div><button class="button outline" type="button" data-messages-refresh>Actualizar</button></div><div class="messages-layout"><div class="messages-list" data-messages-list></div><aside class="message-detail" data-message-detail><p class="admin-empty">Selecciona un mensaje para leerlo.</p></aside></div><p class="admin-error" data-messages-error></p></div></section>
      <section class="admin-view" data-view="reviews" hidden><div class="admin-panel"><div class="admin-panel-head"><div><p class="kicker dark">Control de autenticidad</p><h2>Reseñas</h2></div><button class="button outline" type="button" data-reviews-refresh>Actualizar</button></div><p>Comprueba que correspondan a experiencias reales antes de publicarlas o descartarlas.</p><p class="admin-error" data-reviews-error></p><div class="admin-review-list" data-admin-reviews></div></div></section>    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script src="../scripts/admin-app.ts"></script>
